                <head>No. 4.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">From the Consular Agent at
                            Corunna to the Chargé d’Affaires of the United
                    States.</hi></seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Telegram.—<placeName>Corunna</placeName>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-02-18">February
                        18</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>The confederate captain of the Stonewall has gone to Madrid and Paris.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>FUENTES.</signed></closer>
            </div>
